& [PositiveCase]
  + verified request identity completely determines the fixed plan identity operations environment evidence expectations denials unresolved account and disposition
  + strict canonical JSON duplicate-key rejection domain-separated self digests deterministic UUID derivation and exact independent reconstruction close representation laundering
  + argument atoms are data rather than a shell command string and the pure module exposes no filesystem process environment network provider clock or unsafe surface

& [ChallengeCase]
  + compiler and verifier processes are distinct but both link the same crate; logical independence is a separately constructed derivation rather than implementation diversity
  + stable Rust can refuse direct symlink metadata but the rejected unstable Windows link-count API cannot close hard-link or replacement-race questions inside these CLIs
  + an inert operation record could still be misread as execution authority outside its signed context

& [Resolution]
  + equality spans every plan field and canonical byte while tests redigest hostile mutations; this proves deterministic correspondence without claiming N-version independence
  + literal filenames bounded streamed reads immutable-package custody and physical no-follow hard-link/reparse checks remain mandatory work for the package/deployment layer
  + every operation says authority_required not_granted and the plan retains grants0 denials15 unresolved5 effects0 planned_effectless

& [Decision]
  + approve publication of the pure local core checkpoint
  + do not open remote execution until package builder verifier deployment harness retained evidence and final implementation closure are separately verified published and bookended
